on .docs.workzone.kmd.net Session When using Microsoft Azure as a hosting platform and enabling load balancing, this cookie ensures that  requests from one visitor browsing session are always handled by the same server in the cluster. XSRF-TOKEN event.au.dk 1 hour 59 minutes This cookie is written to help with site security in preventing Cross-Site Request Forgery attacks. li_gc LinkedIn Corporation .linkedin.com 5 months 4 weeks Used to store guest consent to the use of cookies for non-essential purposes x-ms-gateway-slice Microsoft Corporation login.microsoftonline.com Session Identifies a gateway for load balancing. CFTOKEN Adobe Inc. eddiprod.au.dk Session Cookie set by Adobe ColdFusion applications. Used in conjunction with CFID this cookie helps to uniquely identify a client device (browser) to enable the site to maintain user session variables. How those are used are specific to the site. CFTOKEN contains a random number to identify the client. brwConsent .airtable.com 5 minutes This cookie is used to record the user's consent to the use of cookies on the website, ensuring compliance with the website's privacy policy by remembering the user's preferences and consent state regarding cookies. CFTOKEN Adobe Inc. mit.au.dk Session Cookie set by Adobe ColdFusion applications. Used in conjunction with CFID this cookie helps to uniquely identify a client device (browser) to enable the site to maintain user session variables. How those are used are specific to the site. CFTOKEN contains a random number to identify the client. OptanonAlertBoxClosed OneTrust LLC .pure.au.dk 1 year This cookie is set by websites using certain versions of the cookie law compliance solution from OneTrust. It is set after visitors have seen a cookie information notice and in some cases only when they actively close the notice down. It enables the website not to show the message more than once to a user. The cookie has a one year lifespan and contains no personal information. PHPSESSID PHP.