 of this website. These cookies make it possible for the university to target advertising on our websites and social media, so you will see the content that is most relevant for you. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description __atuvc Oracle Corporation .au.dk 1 year This cookie is set by AddThis to adds social share buttons to the website. It stores an updated page share count. moctest .censorerne.dk 1 day This is set to perform a MOC test. vuid Vimeo.com Inc. .vimeo.com 1 year 1 month These cookies are used by the Vimeo video player on websites. UserSettings Panopto au.cloud.panopto.eu 1 year 1 month This cookie is used to store user preferences and settings for the website's video content provided by Panopto. It ensures that preferences like volume level, video resolution, and playback speed are remembered on subsequent visits. _cfuvid .elfsight.com Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. googtrans .iorad.com Session This cookie is used to store the user's language preference and to deliver content in the user's preferred language, ensuring a better user experience. mid Meta Platform Inc. .instagram.com 1 year 1 month This is an Instagram cookie that enables social media functionality within the site. li_alerts LinkedIn www.linkedin.com 1 year This cookie is used to manage subscription service alerts in order to notify a user about job alerts or relevant notifications related to their career interests. au-vacancies-last-visit .au.dk Session This script/cookie records the date+time of the visitor's last visit and displays it upon their return, but can also be hidden. lang .linkedin.com Session There are many different types of cookies associated with this name, and a more detailed look at how it is used on a particular website is generally recommended. However, in most cases it will likely be used to store language pre