y advertising that the end user may have seen before visiting the said website. YSC Google LLC .youtube.com Session This cookie is set by YouTube to track views of embedded videos. _gcl_au Google LLC .au.dk 2 months 4 weeks Used by Google AdSense for experimenting with advertisement efficiency across websites using their services demdex Adobe Inc. .demdex.net 5 months 4 weeks This cookie helps Adobe Audience Manger perform basic functions such as visitor identification, ID synchronization, segmentation, modeling, reporting, etc. _fbp Meta Platform Inc. .au.dk 2 months 4 weeks Used by Meta to deliver a series of advertisement products such as real time bidding from third party advertisers muc_ads Twitter .t.co 1 year 1 month This cookie is used for targeting and advertising purposes. It helps track and personalize advertising content to enhance user experience. lidc Microsoft Corporation .linkedin.com 1 day This is a Microsoft MSN 1st party cookie that ensures the proper functioning of this website. These cookies make it possible for the university to target advertising on our websites and social media, so you will see the content that is most relevant for you. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description __atuvc Oracle Corporation .au.dk 1 year This cookie is set by AddThis to adds social share buttons to the website. It stores an updated page share count. moctest .censorerne.dk 1 day This is set to perform a MOC test. vuid Vimeo.com Inc. .vimeo.com 1 year 1 month These cookies are used by the Vimeo video player on websites. UserSettings Panopto au.cloud.panopto.eu 1 year 1 month This cookie is used to store user preferences and settings for the website's video content provided by Panopto. It ensures that preferences like volume level, video resolution, and playback speed are remembered on subsequent visits. _cfuvid .elfsight.com Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session 