ases it will likely be used to store language preferences, potentially to serve up content in the stored language. brw Airtable .airtable.com 1 year This cookie is used to track user behavior and interaction to improve user experience and service functionality. _cfuvid .pure.au.dk Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. elfsight_viewed_recently Elfsight core.service.elfsight.com 14 seconds This cookie is used to record which items a user has viewed recently on the website to provide an enhanced user experience by showing related content or products based on the user's browsing history. Cookies that have not yet been classified. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description clickedFolder www.isa.au.dk Session urm_se soeg.kb.dk Session esctx-OasV10qUaN0 .login.microsoftonline.com Session OH.SID m365.cloud.microsoft Session bachelor-application-initial-lang .minansoegning.au.dk 1 year __Secure-typo3nonce_pmyJoTrasMnO9YxL_eVzaw inano.medarbejdere.au.dk Session esctx-9kQ4yoZHlkM .login.microsoftonline.com Session eventvaerk_session event.au.dk 1 hour 59 minutes ahoy_visitor www.powr.io 1 year 1 month VXZCPXNY mit.au.dk Session esctx-IEaOixO5w8 .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-EeHPW0ZrGwY .login.microsoftonline.com Session oiosaml-fragment stadssb.au.dk Session __Secure-typo3nonce_EPVu7YV_2sBZCdWlwo43EQ kandidat.au.dk Session QueueITAccepted-SDFrts345E-V3_audkprod2026 minansoegning.au.dk 1 day VXZCPXNY eddiprod.au.dk Session esctx-s8rchb0T81g .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-LGkoxLDsyqs .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-NfWJXy4uzU .login.microsoftonline.com Session idpCode soeg.kb.dk Session selvbetjening stadssb.au.dk Session esctx-b6ApW7aoGco .login.microsoftonline.com Session .AspNetCore.Correlation.Pvuw0yJaPDeqZEdvW7Gq8j907kN0wcBaVaoG-CGDpWo m365.cloud.microsoft 15 minutes 2 seconds esctx-G9jXokPQ0a4 .