okie is set by YouTube to track views of embedded videos. _gcl_au Google LLC .au.dk 2 months 4 weeks Used by Google AdSense for experimenting with advertisement efficiency across websites using their services demdex Adobe Inc. .demdex.net 5 months 4 weeks This cookie helps Adobe Audience Manger perform basic functions such as visitor identification, ID synchronization, segmentation, modeling, reporting, etc. _fbp Meta Platform Inc. .au.dk 2 months 4 weeks Used by Meta to deliver a series of advertisement products such as real time bidding from third party advertisers muc_ads Twitter .t.co 1 year 1 month This cookie is used for targeting and advertising purposes. It helps track and personalize advertising content to enhance user experience. lidc Microsoft Corporation .linkedin.com 1 day This is a Microsoft MSN 1st party cookie that ensures the proper functioning of this website. These cookies make it possible for the university to target advertising on our websites and social media, so you will see the content that is most relevant for you. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description __atuvc Oracle Corporation .au.dk 1 year This cookie is set by AddThis to adds social share buttons to the website. It stores an updated page share count. moctest .censorerne.dk 1 day This is set to perform a MOC test. vuid Vimeo.com Inc. .vimeo.com 1 year 1 month These cookies are used by the Vimeo video player on websites. UserSettings Panopto au.cloud.panopto.eu 1 year 1 month This cookie is used to store user preferences and settings for the website's video content provided by Panopto. It ensures that preferences like volume level, video resolution, and playback speed are remembered on subsequent visits. _cfuvid .elfsight.com Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. googtrans .iorad.com Session This cookie is used to store the user's language preference and to deliver content in the user's preferred language, ensuring a better user experience. mid Meta Platform Inc. .instagram.com 1 year 1 month This is an Instagram cookie that enables social media functionality within the site. li_alerts LinkedIn www.linkedin.com 1 year This cookie is used to manage subscription service alerts in order to notify a user about job alerts or relevant notifications related to their career interests. au-vacancies-last-visit .au.dk Session This script/cookie records the date+time of the visitor's last visit and displays it upon their return, but can also be hidden. lang .linkedin.com Session There are many different types of cookies associated with this name, and a more detailed look at how it is used on a particular website is generally recommended. However, in most cases it will likely be used to store language preferences, potentially to serve up content in the stored language. brw Airtable .airtable.com 1 year This cookie is used to track user behavior and interaction to improve user experience and service functionality. _cfuvid .pure.au.dk Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. elfsight_viewed_recently Elfsight core.service.elfsight.com 14 seconds This cookie is used to record which items a user has viewed recently on the website to provide an enhanced user experience by showing related content or products based on the user's browsing history. Cookies that have not yet been classified. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description clickedFolder www.isa.au.dk Session urm_se soeg.kb.dk Session esctx-OasV10qUaN0 .login.microsoftonline.com Session OH.SID m365.cloud.microsoft Session bachelor-application-initial-lang .minansoegning.au.dk 1 year __Secure-typo3nonce_pmyJoTrasMnO9YxL_eVzaw inano.medarbejdere.au.dk Session esctx-9kQ4yoZHlkM .login.microsoftonline.com Session eventv